            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: 50% 315px
        }
        .card{
            background-color: #fff;
            background-clip: border-box;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.125);
            border-radius: 0 0 .5rem .5rem;
            padding: 20px;
            max-width: 75%;
            width: 600px;
            margin: 0px auto 20px auto;
        }
        strong{
            margin-bottom: .75rem;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: #212529;
        }
        hr{
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 0;
            border-top-color: currentcolor;
            border-top-style: none;
            border-top-width: 0px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.1);
        }
        .btn {
            color: #fff;
            background-color: #007bff;
            display: inline-block;
            font-weight: 400;
            text-align: center;
            vertical-align: middle;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            -moz-user-select: none;
            -ms-user-select: none;
            user-select: none;
            border: 1px solid #007bff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: .25rem .5rem;
            font-size: .875rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            border-radius: 1rem;
        }

        .btn:hover,
        .btn:focus{
            border: 1px solid #212529;
            background-color: #212529;}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="warp">
    <div class="card">

    <p><strong>Le site internet est actuellement indisponible.</strong></p>
    <p>Nous vous prions de nous excuser pour la g&ecirc;ne occasionn&eacute;e <br>et mettons tout en oeuvre pour r&eacute;tablir le service au plus vite.</p>
